OVIDED DIRECTLY TO THE NOMINATOR. THE ILLINOIS AMERICAN"}{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2021-12-15 09:19:00', 'title': 'MISSOURI AMERICAN WELCOMES NEW WATER AND WASTEWATER CUSTOMERS IN GARDEN CITY', 'text': 'GARDEN CITY, MO.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #INFRASTRUCTURE--MISSOURI AMERICAN WATER WELCOMED APPROXIMATELY 778 NEW CUSTOMERS IN GARDEN CITY, LOCATED ROUGHLY 50 MILES SOUTHEAST OF KANSAS CITY.'}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2021-12-15 09:00:00', 'title': 'ANSYS FUELS CARBON-FREE TRANSPORTATION WITH SYNHELION', 'text': "PITTSBURGH, DEC. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- / KEY HIGHLIGHTS SYNHELION UTILIZES ANSYS SOLUTIONS TO ENABLE SUSTAINABLE TRANSPORTATION AND REDUCE CO2 EMISSIONS BY REPLACING FOSSIL FUELS WITH SOLAR FUELS SYNHELION USES ANSYS' MULTIPHYSICS SIMULATION THROUGH THE ANSYS STARTUP PROGRAM TO OVERCOME DESIGN CHALLENGES, PREDICT FUTURE OUTCOMES, AND REDUCE PROTOTYPING TIME SYNHELION WILL BUILD THE WORLD'S FIRST PLANT CAPABLE OF PRODUCING SOLAR FUELS AT AN INDUSTRIAL SCALE IN 2022 ANSYS (NASDAQ: ANSS) SOLUTIONS ARE HELPING SYNHELION STEER TOWARD CLEANER TRANSPORTATION AND NET-ZERO EMISSIONS BY HELPING TO ENABLE THE DEVELOPMENT OF SOLAR FUELS TO REPLACE FOSSIL FUELS. SYNHELION BECAME A MEMBER OF THE ANSYS STARTUP PROGRAM IN THE BEGINNING OF 2020 WHEN COOPERATION WITH THE SWISS ELITE CHANNEL PARTNER CADFEM STARTED."}{'symbol': 'AZO', 'date': '2021-12-15 17:00:00', 'title': 'AUTOZONE AUTHORIZES ADDITIONAL STOCK REPURCHASE', 'text': "MEMPHIS, TENN., DEC. 15, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AUTOZONE, INC. (NYSE: AZO), TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS AUTHORIZED THE REPURCHASE OF AN ADDITIONAL $1.5 BILLION OF THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK IN CONNECTION WITH ITS ONGOING SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM. SINCE THE INCEPTION OF THE REPURCHASE PROGRAM IN 1998, AND INCLUDING THE ABOVE AMOUNT, AUTOZONE'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS AUTHORIZED $29.2 BILLION IN SHARE REPURCHASES."}{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2021-12-15 09:20:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON WEALTH MANAGEMENT NAMED DAVID HECK SENIOR CLIENT STRATEGIST IN PHILADELPHIA', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA, DEC. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BNY MELLON WEALTH MANAGEMENT NAMED DAVID HECK AS SENIOR CLIENT STRATEGIST. IN THIS ROLE, HE WORKS WITH ULTRA-HIGH-NET-WORTH FAMILIES, BUSINESS OWNERS, CORPORATE EXECUTIVES, PRIVATE EQUITY AND HEDGE FUND PRINCIPALS AND THEIR FAMILY OFFICES, AS WELL AS FOUNDATIONS AND ENDOWMENTS ON THEIR COMPREHENSIVE WEALTH NEEDS.'}{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2021-12-15 08:30:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT LAUNCHES THREE ACTIVE SUSTAINABLE ETFS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, DEC. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BNY MELLON INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THREE ACTIVELY MANAGED SUSTAINABLE EXCHANGE-TRADED FUNDS (ETFS): THE BNY MELLON SUSTAINABLE US EQUITY ETF (BKUS), BNY MELLON SUSTAINABLE INTERNATIONAL EQUITY ETF (BKIS) AND BNY MELLON SUSTAINABLE GLOBAL EMERGING MARKETS ETF (BKES). ALL THREE ETFS ARE SUB-ADVISED BY NEWTON INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT LIMITED, A BNY MELLON INVESTMENT FIRM AND A LEADING EQUITY AND MULTI-ASSET MANAGER WITH A LONG TRACK RECORD OF SUSTAINABLE AND RESPONSIBLE INVESTING EXPERIENCE.'}{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2021-12-15 09:00:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER ENTERS LICENSING AGREEMENT WITH POLYCHARGE AMERICA, INC. FOR DISRUPTIVE CAPACITOR TECHNOLOGY', 'text': 'AUBURN HILLS, MICH., DEC. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BORGWARNER IS STRENGTHENING ITS INVERTER CAPABILITIES AND OFFERINGS THROUGH AN EXCLUSIVE LICENSING AGREEMENT WITH POLYCHARGE AMERICA, INC., A STARTUP COMPANY FORMED TO DELIVER DISRUPTIVE CAPACITOR PRODUCTS.'}{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2021-12-15 15:13:00', 'title': 'U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION APPROVES ORENCIA® (ABATACEPT) IN COMBINATION WITH A CALCINEURIN INHIBITOR AND METHOTREXATE FOR THE PREVENTION OF ACUTE GRAFT VERSUS HOST DISEASE (AGVHD).', 'text': 'PRINCETON, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $BMY #BMS--US FDA APPROVES ORENCIA IN COMBINATION WITH A CALCINEURIN INHIBITOR AND METHOTREXATE FOR THE PREVENTION OF ACUTE GRAFT VERSUS HOST DISEASE (AGVHD)...'}{'symbol': 'CARR